  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/eProsima/Fast-CDR/zipball/v2.2.7",
  "body": "## Fixes\r\n\r\n1. First align then save `last_data_size_`  (#283)\r\n2. Fix mutable size-three optional serialization (#277)\r\n3. Fix default fixed-string length bug (#276)\r\n4. XCDRv1: support extra bytes in optional types (#286)\r\n\r\n## Improvements\r\n\r\n1. Make `optional` copy/move constructors actuate only if the storage is engaged (#265)\r\n2. Update README (#261)\r\n3. Change colcon.pkg dependencies to be test-dependencies (#294) \r\n\r\n## Improvements on CI\r\n1. Remove deprecated windows-2019 runner  (#271)\r\n2. Improvements in CI workflows (#297)\r\n3. Build with warning as errors (#290)\r\n\r\nPRs in merged order:\r\n\r\n#261, #265, #271, #276, #277, #283, #286, #290, #294, #298, #302"
 },
